  }

--- V2 negative (CVE-2025-58745 fix closes the residual) ---
  original @v2 : upload_status=404 (endpoint deleted) -> BLOCKED
  residual @v2 : upload_status=404 (endpoint deleted) -> BLOCKED
  GET /html/socio/sistema/controller/controla_xlsx.php @v2 => 404

RESULT  : gate_passed. Differential is a genuine incomplete-fix residual:
